# NOTE: This is a DELIBERATELY-DISABLED template, not an active lane. effGen's
# release process is intentionally MANUAL (no automated PyPI publish on a GitHub
# release): build + inspect in a temp dir, fresh-env install smoke, then a human
# uploads. See docs/installation.md and the release runbook. To publish:
#
#   python -m build && twine upload dist/*
#
# The `.disabled` extension keeps this out of GitHub's workflow loader on purpose.
# Before re-enabling, configure PyPI Trusted Publishing (OIDC), re-pin the action
# versions below (e.g. pypa/gh-action-pypi-publish@release/v1), and rename to
# release.yml.

